From: fesmazz <fernandosmazzilli@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 00:15:04 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat(agent-team): let spawn_teammate route child models

Add optional agentOptions to SpawnTeammateRequest and optional provider/model/
reasoning_effort to the spawn_teammate tool. The tool validates and preflights
the route through ctx.llm, then passes it to startActivation; omitted fields
inherit the Lead route.

Co-Authored-By: DeepSeek Flash
